<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Added to the Mac app's Info.plist (tauri.macos.conf.json, infoPlist). Tauri writes the file
     types from fileAssociations but has no place for a type's icon, and keys here replace its own,
     so the whole list of types is here, kept in step with fileAssociations by
     tests/file-icons.test.ts. SI project files (.chemsi) are Chemweave's own type: it is declared
     here (UTExportedTypeDeclarations) with its icon, Resources/chemsi.icns, made by
     scripts/make-file-icons.mjs. NSMicrophoneUsageDescription is what macOS shows when it asks
     about the microphone for Slide Show > Record; without it the request is refused unasked. -->
